{"articleNo":"86793","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=86793&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 2학기 휴ㆍ복학 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.07.15","hit":"8930","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">★ 휴·복학 신청 안내 ★</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 2013학년도 2학기 휴·복학신청을 인터넷으로 접수받습니다. 안내문에 따라 원스톱서비스에서 신청하시기 바라며, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">휴·복학 확정 여부를 반드시 확인하여 학적상의 불이익이 발생하지 않도록 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※필수 유의사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"93\" valign=\"center\" width=\"631\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;2013학년도 2학기 복학자 중 전공 미배정된 복학생에 대한 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ο 대상자 : 2013학년도 2학기 복학자 중 전공 미배정된 복학자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ο 금오공대 홈페이지 학사안내 게시판 중 ‘</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2013학년도 2학기 복학생 학과 변경 알림</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">’</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">글을 참고하시길 바랍니다.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 휴학 신청(인터넷 신청) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffff66\" height=\"27\" valign=\"center\" width=\"79\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffff66\" height=\"27\" valign=\"center\" width=\"91\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">일반 휴학</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffff66\" height=\"27\" valign=\"center\" width=\"374\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"